  description: '2 Level 4 "tellarknight" monsters

    All face-up monsters on the
    field become DARK. You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card and discard 1
    card; Special Summon from your Extra Deck, 1 LIGHT "tellarknight" Xyz Monster
    by using this face-up card you control as the Xyz Material, also you cannot Xyz
    Summon other monsters for the rest of this turn. (This is treated as an Xyz Summon.
    Xyz Materials attached to this card also become Xyz Materials on the Summoned
    monster.) This effect can be activated during either player''s turn, if you have
    7 or more "tellarknight" monsters with different names in your Graveyard.'
